Common PositionVacancy
    documentation "The set of elements that describe the reason for vacancy and the date of the vacancy."
    date DatePositionVacant
        documentation "DatePositionVacant indicates the date when the position becomes vacant. This should be the day after the final day of employment for the individual currently holding the position."
        is required
    descriptor VacancyReason
        documentation "VacancyReason indicates the reason that the position became vacant."
        is required